contentText:
Cornell University has canceled its upcoming homecoming concert amid backlash over its handling of sexual assault allegations.

The Cornell Concert Commission announced on Instagram Friday (Oct. 9) that it had canceled a homecoming concert featuring indie-pop duo Between Friends, which was scheduled for Oct. 17 at Barton Hall in Ithaca, New York.

